  "A short questionnaire that ranks all 154 role families in the Career Explorer against what you studied, what you would enjoy doing and how you want to work, and shows the reasons, the obstacles and the research behind each one.": "Ce court questionnaire classe 154 groupes de métiers selon vos études, vos intérêts et votre façon de travailler. Il montre les raisons, les difficultés et les recherches utilisées.",
